+   | Based on code from: Richard J. Wagner <rjwagner@writeme.com>         |
+   |                     Makoto Matsumoto <matumoto@math.keio.ac.jp>      |
+   |                     Takuji Nishimura                                 |
+   |                     Shawn Cokus <Cokus@math.washington.edu>          |
+   +----------------------------------------------------------------------+
